le!<br /> <br /> \u200bOk, I know almost nothing about Beast: The Primordial but the way the game seems makes me think it shares a lot of themes, and the antagonist Gaston is much like what I imagine a Hero could look like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-07T11:55:35-08:00","id":1045265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aristarkos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1027789-btp-movies?p=1044814#post1044814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beauty and the Beast, anyone? It even has Beast in the title!<br /> <br /> \u200bOk, I know almost nothing about Beast: The Primordial but the way the game seems makes me think it shares a lot of themes, and the antagonist Gaston is much like what I imagine a Hero could look like.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It can work pretty well. Gaston was actually floated as an idea of what a Hero is like back during the Development. I've thought about stating them both out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.im